        "# Key function\n",
        "\n",
        "A key function computes a comparison key from an element. For example, `sorted(words, key=len)` orders words by length.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-key-function)"
      ]
